<http://data.silknow.org/object/7997893d-fe7e-3c1f-82ed-fc6585dd50f8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Shawl of twill, Paisley, Scotland, ca. 1850-1855."@en , "Loosely woven twill shawl. It has a band of woven design across the centre, which separates a white ground from one of bright red. The deep end, side borders and long stems of flowers are in bright pink, bright green, mid blue, sand and reddish-brown. \n\nThe warp is dyed in white, for the white ground, and in brown, for the red ground. The selvedges are green and red-brown, very loosely woven. The fringe is applied in black, green, pale yellow and blue silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/6e357488-32a7-3994-b94c-3a98efb5afea> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b7bf1acf-dd9c-3d8b-8493-d57afc0e658b> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f88f6af7-acb3-3cd7-897f-ecabd4c479d9> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Loosely woven twill shawl. It has a band of woven design across the centre, which separates a white ground from one of bright red. The deep end, side borders and long stems of flowers are in bright pink, bright green, mid blue, sand and reddish-brown. \n\nThe warp is dyed in white, for the white ground, and in brown, for the red ground. The selvedges are green and red-brown, very loosely woven. The fringe is applied in black, green, pale yellow and blue silk."@en , "Shawl of twill, Paisley, Scotland, ca. 1850-1855."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7997893d-fe7e-3c1f-82ed-fc6585dd50f8/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7997893d-fe7e-3c1f-82ed-fc6585dd50f8/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7997893d-fe7e-3c1f-82ed-fc6585dd50f8/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7997893d-fe7e-3c1f-82ed-fc6585dd50f8/dimension/4> ;
